e prepaid materials provided."}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"clocks_item swiper-slide","role":"group","aria-label":"3 / 3","style":"margin-right: 24px;"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"clocks_item-image"},"children":[{"tag":"img","hidden":false,"attributes":{"src":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a690902b7542dce41e5590a_How%20does%20trauge%20work%2003.png","loading":"lazy","alt":""}}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"clocks_item-title-wrap"},"children":[{"tag":"h4","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"title-h4-v2 blue is-light"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Receive Actionable Results"}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"text-regular light-blue"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Results are available in your Provider Portal within 2–4 weeks from the date the lab receives the sample, including biological age, organ system–level ages, and aging speed, ready to review with your patient."}]}]}]},{"tag":"span","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"swiper-notification","aria-live":"assertive","aria-atomic":"true"}}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"section_developed is-v2"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"padding-global"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"container-large"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_layout"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_title-wrap is-v2"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"title-h2-new blue"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"The Aging Clocks of TruAge"}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_list"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_wrapper is-white"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_content"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_strapline-wrap"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_strapline is-dark"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"DEVELOPED WITH HARVARD"}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_title-wrap"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"title-h2-new is-light"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Biological Age"}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_tag-wrapper"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_tag"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"OMICmAge™"}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_text-wrap"},"children":[{"tag":"p","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_text is-dark"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"The OMICmAge™ algorithm is one of the most precise and comprehensive methods for measuring biological aging. Its multi-omic approach analyzes proteins, metabolites, and clinical biomarkers to reveal the true state of the body’s aging process — and the factors accelerating or decelerating it — empowering you to optimize patient health and potentially slow aging."}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_cta-wrap"},"children":[{"tag":"a","hidden":false,"attributes":{"data-wf--global-cta-yellow--variant":"modify","href":"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/omicmage","class":"cta-yellow w-variant-927ae097-63d8-7236-ec7b-a65ed4a0b41b w-inline-block"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"text-regular blue cta"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Learn More"}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"cta-yellow-icon w-variant-927ae097-63d8-7236-ec7b-a65ed4a0b41b w-embed"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"\n"}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"cta-yellow-icon-v2 w-variant-927ae097-63d8-7236-ec7b-a65ed4a0b41b w-embed"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"\n"}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_image"},"children":[{"tag":"img","hidden":false,"attributes":{"src":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a5dff43a1df570fa5ec7cb4_Image.png","loading":"lazy","alt":"","class":"developed_img"}}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_wrapper is-blue"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_content"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_strapline-wrap"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_strapline is-dark"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"DEVELOPED BY YALE"}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_title-wrap"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"title-h2-new is-light"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Organ System Aging"}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_tag-wrapper"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_tag is-white"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"SYMPHONYAge™"}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_text-wrap"},"children":[{"tag":"p","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_text is-dark"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"SYMPHONYAge™ offers a revolutionary way to understand aging across multiple organ systems. This system-specific epigenetic algorithm evaluates organs like the brain, liver, heart, and immune system independently, pinpointing where targeted health interventions may be most effective. Easy-to-read reports deliver actionable recommendations and highlight key areas for improvement, allowing providers to direct protocols to where biological burden is the highest."}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"developed_cta-wrap"},"children":[{"tag":"a","hidden":false,"attributes":{"data-wf--global-cta-yellow--variant":"modify","href":"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/symphony-age",